-		// ladder twice on the same input without any filter, and lowered the cutoff by up to about half a semitone
-		// for how that shifted it. The ladder at 88.2 kHz with half the normalised cutoff is the same filter (the
-		// TPT stages' prewarp: tan(pi f / 2 fs)), so the cutoff stays where it is set
+		// mastertune v18: 2x oversampled with real half-band filters (halfband.h, renderDriveOversampled()) where
+		// FilterSet wants it (v18.3: where 1.2.1 oversampled, see driveWantsOversampling(); v18 did at every
+		// setting). 1.2.1 ran the ladder twice on the same input without any filter, and lowered the cutoff by up to
+		// about half a semitone for how that shifted it. The ladder at 88.2 kHz with half the normalised cutoff is
